# 文本文件统一交给 git 判断，避免 CRLF/LF 混入 diff
* text=auto

# 二进制：禁止换行符转换与文本 diff
*.uasset  binary
*.umap    binary
*.uexp    binary
*.ubulk   binary
*.png     binary
*.jpg     binary
*.jpeg    binary
*.xlsx    binary
*.uproject binary

